--- .gitignore (原始)
# Python-generated files
__pycache__/
*.py[oc]
build/
wheels/
*.egg-info

# Project files
.venv
.idea/
.DS_Store
.env
.vscode/
.old
node_modules/
dist/
data/*.json
reports/coverage/lcov-report/
reports/coverage/lcov.info

+++ .gitignore (修改后)
```
# Compiled and build artifacts
*.pyc
__pycache__/
*.o
*.obj
dist/
build/
target/

